  "review": {
    "kind": "behavior",
    "description": "W-CONFIGURATION-CHAT, W-EFFECTIVE-SETTINGS and W-CONFIGURATION-PROPOSAL receive credential-redacted native snapshots. Proposed safe edits remain readable and require their separate explicit confirmation. Credential edits and redacted placeholders are refused.",
    "implementation": "Reviewed nativeSnapshot/newNativeRedactor/value/text, native inspection in NativeConfig and dynamic, proposal construction, raw BeforeDigest confirmation/application checks, and startup sanitizeNativeProposal. Raw native responses remain transient and nativeOverrides remains unchanged; stored snapshots and diffs contain redacted values. Migration retains pending safe edits, stales credential edits and preserves historical freshness without replay. All work remains on existing background preparation/operation paths; no request-time I/O or cancellation deadline is introduced. Follow-up review fixes preserve native-generated layer selectors, distinguish nonsecret MCP argument/environment values from known credentials, collect credential URL components for copied-value redaction, and sanitize legacy proposal event data transactionally in pages of 32 while preserving sequence, kind, entity, timestamps, historical states and unrelated fields. Native named-entry containers distinguish identifier keys from actual credential setting keys; nativeKeyPath uses the existing TOML parser to preserve quoted identifiers and dotted project paths while validating the targeted setting context.",
    "tests": "Read TestNativeInspectionRedactsUnmanagedCredentials: both exported/native-agent inspection outputs exclude unmanaged credentials and retain exact profiles and layer versions without mutating native input. TestNativeProposalRetainsRedactedSnapshotAndRawFreshness requires a stored safe snapshot, unchanged public view after hidden password rotation, rejected stale confirmation and one exact fresh profile write. TestNativeCredentialEditsAreRejectedWithoutPersistence rejects nested env replacements, copied secret values, token patterns, credential URLs and placeholders without saved proposals/writes. TestNativeLegacyProposalMigrationPreservesStaleness checks safe migration, unchanged raw fingerprint, stale unsafe edits, no writes and idempotence. Existing race tests pass; live-host verification must be rerun after deployment. The selector/URL-copy regression exercises HOME, MODE and ordinary CLI values alongside a short URL password, token query and OAuth fragment, then proposes using the exact displayed file/version. Legacy migration now seeds real configuration events and 35 orphaned historical events, injects failure after one attempted update to prove rollback, verifies all pages and stable metadata/state, and compares repeated migration byte-for-byte. Inspection also asserts exact MaxInt64 numeric preservation. TestNativeCredentialWordsInNamesRemainEditable checks token/secret-scan/dotted profile names, a .secrets project path, plugin/server identifiers, whole-profile replacements and quoted native edits, while proving real API-key/password/environment fields inside those same named entries cannot bypass masking or edit rejection."
  },
